    "Aquí anotas lo que pagas para el negocio: materiales, renta, gasolina, software…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is where you write down what you pay for the business: materials, rent, gas, software…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aquí guardas a las personas y empresas a las que les vendes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is where you keep the people and companies you sell to."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aquí van las facturas que te mandan tus proveedores y que pagarás más adelante." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These are the bills your vendors send you that you'll pay later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aquí van los saldos con que empezaste los libros. Tu contador suele pasarlos a «Capital del dueño» con un asiento al cerrar el año." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This holds the balances you started your books with. Your accountant usually moves them to “Owner’s equity” with an entry at year-end."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aquí verás cada cambio de tus libros, con la fecha y el aparato en que se hizo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You’ll see every change to your books here, with the date and the device it was made on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aquí verás cada cobro, gasto y pago de esta cuenta, con su saldo. Si pusiste dinero de tu bolsillo para empezar, regístralo aquí." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Here you'll see every payment received, expense and payment made in this account, with its balance. If you put in your own money to get started, record it here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aquí verás cómo va tu negocio" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is where you’ll see how your business is doing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aquí verás los pagos programados, las facturas vencidas y el impuesto por declarar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scheduled payments, overdue invoices and sales tax to file will show up here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aquí ves el dinero de cada cuenta del negocio: el banco, el ahorro y la tarjeta." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Here you see the money in each business account: checking, savings and your card."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aquí ves si el negocio gana dinero, cuánto tiene y quién te debe. Salen de tus facturas y tus gastos: no tienes que escribir nada." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "See whether the business makes money, what it has and who owes you. They come from your invoices and expenses: there's nothing to type."
          }
        }
      }
    },
