    "Con borrador" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Has a draft"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con cargo automático se registran solos; sin él, quedan por confirmar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With autopay they’re recorded automatically; without it, they wait for you to confirm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con cobros o créditos no se edita: usa una nota de crédito." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With payments or credits it can't be edited: use a credit note."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con débitos y créditos, cuenta por cuenta" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With debits and credits, account by account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con ellos guardados, anotar un gasto es más rápido y sabes cuánto le pagas a cada uno (también para el 1099)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With them saved, adding an expense is faster and you know how much you pay each one (also for the 1099)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con estos términos y este mensaje nacen las facturas y los estimados nuevos (los del cliente mandan si los tiene)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "New invoices and estimates start with these terms and this message (the customer's own terms win if set)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con fecha de fin" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Has end date"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con impuesto incluido, el precio de cada línea ya lleva el impuesto y Chirogra lo separa al emitir. El origen de las ventas es informativo: tú eliges la tasa de cada factura." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With tax included, each line's price already includes tax and Chirogra separates it when issuing. Sales sourcing is for reference: you choose the rate on each invoice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con recibo" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With receipt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con saldo" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With balance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con saldo pendiente" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With open balance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con sus datos guardados, facturar es elegir un nombre, y ves de un vistazo quién te debe." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With their details saved, invoicing is just picking a name, and you see at a glance who owes you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con una contraseña de cierre, solo quien la sepa podrá registrar o cambiar algo con fecha cerrada. Sin ella, se podrá hacer escribiendo el motivo, que quedará en el historial." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With a closing password, only someone who knows it can record or change anything with a closed date. Without one, it can be done by entering a reason, which stays in the history."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con varias reglas que coinciden, gana la de mayor prioridad. Si registra sola y no puede (periodo cerrado…), el movimiento queda por revisar con su propuesta." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When several rules match, the one with the highest priority wins. If it records automatically and can’t (closed period…), the transaction stays to review with its suggestion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
