            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paste your Stripe Payment Link, Square, PayPal.me or other link. If your service supports it, type {amount}, {number} or {customer} and each invoice fills in its balance, number and customer. Without “Pay Now”, the invoice shows neither the link nor the instructions."
