    },
    "Se desmarcan sus partidas y se borra. Tus asientos no cambian." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Its items are unchecked and it’s deleted. Your entries don’t change."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se muestran así: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shown as: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se omitirán %lld filas que no se leen: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld row that can’t be read will be skipped: %@"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld rows that can’t be read will be skipped: %@"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Se omitirá %lld fila que no se lee: %@"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Se omitirán %lld filas que no se leen: %@"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se paga el %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paid on %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se pagarán desde %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Will be paid from %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se pide para reabrir un periodo y para registrar algo con una fecha cerrada." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Required to reopen a period and to record something with a closed date."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se prueban de mayor a menor prioridad; la primera que coincide propone la categoría. Las que «registran solas» guardan el movimiento sin pasar por la bandeja." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "They’re tried from highest to lowest priority; the first one that matches suggests the category. The ones that “record automatically” save the transaction without going through the inbox."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se reclasificaron %lld gastos." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld expenses were reclassified."
          }
        }
