    "Tus datos salen en tus facturas; los cambias en Ajustes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your details appear on your invoices; change them in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus facturas cobran %@ (%@). Si no es la tasa de tu dirección, cámbiala en Impuestos." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your invoices charge %@ (%@). If that’s not the rate for your address, change it in Taxes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus facturas cobran %@ (%@). Si tu ciudad o condado cobra más, abre Impuestos y elige «Nueva tasa»: la sumamos a esta." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your invoices charge %@ (%@). If your city or county charges more, open Taxes and choose “New rate”: we’ll add it to this one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus facturas cobrarán %@: %@ %@ + %@ %@. Lo cambias cuando quieras en Impuestos." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your invoices will charge %@: %@ %@ + %@ %@. You can change it anytime in Taxes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus facturas cobrarán la tasa de %@ (%@). Si tu ciudad o condado cobra su parte, escribe su nombre y te pedimos su tasa." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your invoices will charge the %@ rate (%@). If your city or county charges its own share, enter its name and we’ll ask for its rate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus facturas cobrarán la tasa estatal de %@ (%@). Si tu ciudad o condado cobra más, añade su parte en Impuestos › Nueva tasa y la sumamos. Revisa que las tasas sean las de tu negocio." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your invoices will charge the %@ state rate (%@). If your city or county charges more, add its part in Taxes › New Rate and we’ll add it up. Check that the rates are right for your business."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus facturas nuevas cobrarán %@ (%@ %@ + %@ %@). Las juntamos en el grupo «%@», que verás en Impuestos." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your new invoices will charge %@ (%@ %@ + %@ %@). We combine them in the group “%@”, which you’ll see in Taxes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus facturas nuevas cobrarán %@ más esta tasa." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your new invoices will charge %@ plus this rate."
