    },
    "Tus facturas nuevas cobrarán esta tasa." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your new invoices will charge this rate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus facturas nuevas seguirán cobrando %@ (%@). Podrás elegir esta tasa en cada factura." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your new invoices will keep charging %@ (%@). You can choose this rate on each invoice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus facturas nuevas seguirán sin impuesto. Podrás elegir esta tasa en cada factura." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your new invoices will stay without tax. You can choose this rate on each invoice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus facturas ya cobran el impuesto predeterminado. Añade la tasa de tu ciudad o condado si la hay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your invoices already charge the default tax. Add your city or county rate if there is one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus libros completos en tu iPhone, iPad y Mac: facturas, gastos, sales tax y reportes, privados en tu cuenta." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your complete books on your iPhone, iPad and Mac: invoices, expenses, sales tax and reports, private to your account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus libros cuadran con el extracto al %@. Lo conciliado queda marcado y la app avisará si algo lo cambia." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your books match the statement as of %@. Reconciled items stay marked and the app will warn you if anything changes them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus libros están en solo lectura porque la suscripción terminó. Suscríbete para seguir registrando." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your books are read-only because your subscription ended. Subscribe to keep recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus libros se llevan en dólares (USD). El estado decide el sales tax que cobras; es obligatorio." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your books are kept in US dollars (USD). Your state determines the sales tax you charge; it’s required."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus libros son ahora los de la copia del %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your books now match the backup from %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus libros viajan cifrados en tu cuenta privada de iCloud entre tu iPhone, iPad y Mac. El cambio se aplica al volver a abrir la app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your books travel encrypted in your private iCloud account between your iPhone, iPad, and Mac. The change takes effect the next time you open the app."
          }
