    "USD · Dólar" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "USD · Dollar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un asiento es el registro contable de un movimiento. Chirogra los hace solo cuando facturas, cobras o anotas un gasto." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A journal entry is the accounting record of a transaction. Chirogra makes them on its own when you invoice, get paid or add an expense."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un asiento necesita al menos dos líneas." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A journal entry needs at least two lines."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un estimado es un presupuesto: le dices al cliente cuánto costará antes de empezar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An estimate is a quote: you tell the customer what it will cost before you start."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un estimado no registra nada en la contabilidad. Al convertirlo en factura se crea un borrador." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An estimate doesn't record anything in your books. Converting it creates a draft invoice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un estimado que ya pasó a factura no se edita." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An estimate that was already invoiced can't be edited."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un panel con lo pendiente de cada empresa" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A panel with what each business has pending"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Una columna" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One column"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Una copia por empresa para entregársela a tu cliente" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A backup per business to hand to your client"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Una cuenta con movimientos no cambia de tipo; crea una cuenta nueva y reclasifica con un asiento." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An account with transactions can't change type; create a new account and reclassify with a journal entry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Una cuenta con subcuentas no cambia de tipo." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An account with subaccounts can't change type."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Una cuenta no puede ser subcuenta de sí misma." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An account can't be a subaccount of itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Una factura es lo que le mandas a tu cliente para cobrarle un trabajo o una venta." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An invoice is what you send your customer to get paid for a job or a sale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Una factura por pagar recurrente necesita proveedor." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A recurring bill needs a vendor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Una recurrente es un gasto que se repite: la renta, el seguro, una suscripción." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A recurring expense is one that repeats: rent, insurance, a subscription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Una regla categoriza sola los movimientos que se parecen: «si la descripción contiene UBER → Transporte»." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A rule categorizes similar transactions on its own: “if the description contains UBER → Travel”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Una regla del banco coincide con la descripción" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A bank rule matches the description"
          }
        }
